//     /**
//      * Calculate the soundex key of a string.
//      *
//      * Calculates the soundex key of this string. Soundex keys have the property that
//      * words pronounced similarly produce the same soundex key, so it can be used to
//      * simplify searches where one does not know the correct spelling of a word.
//      *
//      * @param string $s The string this method is called on.
