//      *                     of the string compared to the length of `$needle` after accounting for offsets.
//      * @param bool $case_insensitive If `true`, comparison is case-insensitive. Defaults to `false`.
//      * @return int Returns `< 0` if `$s` from the offset is less than `$needle`; `> 0` if greater;
//      *             and `0` if they are equal.
