//      *                          in `$s`. If negative, counting starts from the end of `$s`.
//      * @param array|int|null $length If given and is positive, it represents the length of the portion of `$s`
//      *                               which is to be replaced. If negative, it represents the number of characters
//      *                               from the end of `$s` at which to stop replacing. Defaults to `null`
//      *                               (use the rest of the string).
//      * @return string|array The result string is returned. If `$s` is an array then an array is returned
//      *                      (for the string extension receiver, typically a string).
//      *
