//      *                    string will start at the `$offset`th character from the end of `$s`.
//      * @param ?int $length If `$length` is given and is positive, the string returned will contain at most
//      *                     `$length` characters beginning from `$offset`. If negative, that many characters
//      *                     will be omitted from the end of `$s`. Defaults to `null` (return the rest of the string).
