//      *                   `JSON_INVALID_UTF8_SUBSTITUTE`, `JSON_OBJECT_AS_ARRAY`, `JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR`. Defaults to `0`.
//      * @return mixed The value encoded in JSON in appropriate PHP type. Values `true`, `false` and `null`
//      *               are returned as `true`, `false` and `null` respectively. `null` is returned if the
//      *               JSON cannot be decoded or if the encoded data is deeper than the nesting limit
//      *               (unless `JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR` is set).
